{
  "id": "Temporal.PlainYearMonth",
  "name": "Temporal.PlainYearMonth",
  "kind": "class",
  "description": "The Temporal.PlainYearMonth object represents the year and month of a calendar date, without a day or time zone; for example, an event on a calendar that happens during the whole month. It is fundamentally represented as an ISO 8601 calendar date, with year, month, and day fields, and an associated calendar system. The day is used to disambiguate the year-month in non-ISO calendar systems.",
